This product includes software developed at MMPWorks LLC and contributed
back to the open-source community under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The reference implementations in this repository (core, ledger, verifier)
are intended to be conforming examples of the chain-of-custody specification
in spec/. The specification is the normative document; implementations
conform to the specification.

This product makes use of:
  - Go standard library cryptographic primitives (crypto/hmac, crypto/sha256,
    crypto/ed25519) — Apache 2.0 / BSD style
  - OpenTelemetry Go SDK and OTLP libraries — Apache 2.0
  - Other dependencies as declared in each module's go.mod

The "FFIEC" name in this repository's identifier refers to the Federal
Financial Institutions Examination Council. This project is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the FFIEC or any of its member agencies.
The repository name reflects the regulatory framework this work is designed
to satisfy.
